Fullscreen flicker on the Intel GPU (user)
------------------------------------------
Image Lab in fullscreen: every right click flickered and the window went
behind the others (the taskbar brought it back); UseGPU=0 cured it, and
on the Dell XPS 15 it is the Intel GPU only (NVIDIA fine). Known problem
(Khronos forum "TrackPopupMenu breaks full-screen OpenGL window": one
pixel less fixed it; Qt gives such windows a border): a GPU window that
covers its screen exactly gets the driver's full-screen path, a popup
forces it out.
- TMainForm.SetFullscreen (both programs): no more wsFullScreen; a
  borderless window one pixel taller than its monitor (Monitor.BoundsRect,
  bottom + 1). Back: wsNormal, sizeable, the place before.

