measurement of µm vs. pixels; its own file (calibrations.ini); a
"Confocal" check box in the left side panel (checked: width and zoom
kept and scaled; unchecked: pixels per µm); filled from the main screen
when a reference measurement is made; the selector at the bottom of the
left side panel; a settings tab. Exports borrow a matching .lif's scale
by name; a scale bar's length goes into the saved file's name.
Checked first: the exported TIFFs (sample_Series084_t242_ch01.tif,
