Gesture up (user)
-----------------
"the mouse gesture up is supposed to change dir. it does the recursion
(status bar), but the change does not happen ... some sort of influence on
the left / right gestures" - as specified in v1.3: Parent folder widened
the tree by a level and kept the image (so the folder steps then walked
the old folder's siblings). User: "unintuitive, maybe mis-specified";
option 1: up into the parent folder, on its own first image (siblings
skipped); without images of its own a message. TMView.ParentFolder +
FolderHasImages (an image or a container directly in the folder): "up
to ..." / "no images in ... (browsing from there; the image stays)".
Spec v1.3 Sec. (navigation) amended.

